  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Planet X and planet Y are considered to be perfect black bodies. The power radiated by planet X is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P_X\"></span>, the power radiated by planet Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P_Y\"></span>, the radius of planet x is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_X\"></span>and the radius of planet Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_Y\"></span>. <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P_X}{P_Y}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R_X}{R_Y}\"></span> = 4. The absolute mean temperature of the surface of planet X is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T_X\"></span> and the absolute mean temperature of the surface of planet Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T_Y\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the value of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T_X}{T_Y}\"></span> ?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">2</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
